er must inspect native DNS before resuming this operation.\nThe switch has no previous DNS engine, so no frozen source ownership receipt is required. Native DNS still needs verification before the operation resumes.\nNative unit pdns.service: load=masked active=inactive unit-file=masked.\nThese systemd properties were observed at one instant; they do not prove DNS answers, zone content, owner edits or recovery authority.\nRelease and host mutation locks were held; the same evidence bytes and native unit properties matched again after native checks, and the accepted worker was rechecked. Future worker liveness, unobserved DNS answers, owner edits and recovery authority remain unproved.\n", "output_bytes": 2313, "output_sha256": "b335db5165215bde5847fc52688bece704f6b7d10671341cd0b1e98f4df0e1e1", "output_truncated": false, "ran": true, "returncode": 0}, "judged": "made no mutation only", "mutated": false, "stage": "owner-release"}}, "panel": {"detail": {"address": "127.0.0.1", "port": 2083}, "ok": true}, "panel_restart": {"argv": ["/usr/bin/systemctl", "restart", "celikpanel-panel.service"], "duration_seconds": 0.032301, "output_bytes": 0, "output_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "output_truncated": false, "returncode": 0}, "release": {"job": {"attempt": 1, "deadline_at": "2026-09-30T00:30:58.858533481Z", "error_code": "dns_native_recovery_unknown_after_restart", "error_message": "The first install of PowerDNS as the paired primary found that the PowerDNS configuration is not as this install wrote it (an administrator edit, PowerDNS behaviour CelikPanel has not measured, or a file it could not read). CelikPanel kept that change and neither continued nor undid the install. The PowerDNS service is not running on this server now, so this server does not answer DNS. The operation's journal and the PowerDNS database are kept and block new DNS changes; other server changes can continue. Next step: the server administrator reviews t